Bind Npc 29070 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 29071 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 791 "[Crack of All Means] Developing antibiotic?"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Order of the Sorcery] Gater."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Order of the Sorcery] Knocker."

Requires player level >= 55 and quest 790 is completed

Rewards
    Give 1 of 900330000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Phew.. Finally. Go find Gator."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Phew.. Finally. Go find Noker."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You're back. I've received the story from Ramark with the result."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Made [Complete Antibiotic] combining the [Shiny Fruit Juice] and [Clean Old Tree Sap].\n\nWe can't be sure that this will resolve completely.\n\nTalk to Gator about antibiotic study."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You're back. I've received the story from Ramark with the result."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Made [Complete Antibiotic] combining the [Shiny Fruit Juice] and [Clean Old Tree Sap].\n\nWe can't be sure that this will resolve completely.\n\nTalk to Noker about antibiotic study."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Please deliver this [Completed Antibiotic] to Herga and do as he says. I'll try to find out if we can make more of this antibiotics."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Please deliver this [Completed Antibiotic] to Nez and do as he says. I'll try to find out if we can make more of this antibiotics."
